B.bW6=new A.a(B.a,["Basketball | Shoulder | ACL Injury | Reduce Pain | Beginner | Lesson 1","Definition\\n- This lesson explains how Shoulder mechanics, Squat patterning, and Reduce Pain apply to Basketball with emphasis on ACL Injury management.\\n\\nWhy it matters\\n- Better movement decisions improve tissue tolerance, control load, and support safer performance progression.\\n\\nHow to apply it\\n- Assess baseline quality, choose the smallest effective change, monitor symptoms, and progress only when quality remains stable.\\n\\nCommon mistakes\\n- Progressing too fast, ignoring fatigue, using one intervention for every athlete, and skipping movement quality checks.\\n\\nQuick self-check\\n- Can you identify the main limitation, the best regression, the best progression, and the key coaching cue for this case?",u.d,"Beginner",B.a_9,"ACL Injury","Basketball","Shoulder","Reduce Pain","Beginner","Squat","rehabilitation",1],t.R)
